---
// SapAiBridge.astro - Interactive Architecture Diagram: The Bridge between SAP S/4HANA & AI
---

<section id="bridge" class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-12">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center space-y-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full glass-panel border border-cyan-500/40 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-mono tracking-widest uppercase shadow-neon-cyan/20">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-ping"></span>
        <span>Arquitectura de Solución Corporativa</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black font-display text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        El Puente: <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-sky-300 to-purple-400">SAP S/4HANA & Agentes IA</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300/80 leading-relaxed font-normal">
        Cómo articulé la sinergia entre los módulos empresariales (MM, PS, FICO) y la automatización autónoma con Python para transformar migraciones complejas en flujos ágiles y medibles.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Interactive Architecture Flow Canvas / Container -->
    <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 border border-cyan-500/30 relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-2xl">
      
      <!-- Ambient Backlight -->
      <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[300px] bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none"></div>

      <!-- Top Status Banner -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-6 border-b border-white/10 font-mono text-xs text-slate-400">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
          <span class="text-slate-200 font-bold">CASO DE ÉXITO REAL: CLÍNICA INTERNACIONAL & SEIDOR</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-purple-950/60 text-purple-300 border border-purple-700/50">80% Reducción de Tiempo</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-cyan-950/60 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-700/50">Clean Core Ready</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 4-Step Interactive Pipeline Flow -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 pt-8 relative">
        
        <!-- Step 1: Legacy Extraction -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-5 border border-white/10 hover:border-cyan-400/50 transition-all duration-300 relative group space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 text-cyan-400 font-mono font-black flex items-center justify-center text-sm border border-cyan-500/30">
              01
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase">Input Legado</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-display group-hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">
            Extracción & Datos Legados
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Millones de registros de maestros de materiales, proveedores, cuentas contables y órdenes en SAP ECC y bases SQL heterogéneas.
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-400 flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
            <span>Millones de Registros</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2: Python AI Pipeline -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-5 border border-purple-500/40 hover:border-purple-400 transition-all duration-300 relative group space-y-3 shadow-neon-purple/20">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-purple-950 text-purple-300 font-mono font-black flex items-center justify-center text-sm border border-purple-500/50">
              02
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-purple-300 uppercase font-bold">Pipeline IA</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-display group-hover:text-purple-300 transition-colors">
            ETL Automatizado con IA
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300/90 leading-relaxed">
            Scripting en Python con modelos de validación y limpieza semántica que transforman y ajustan los datos a plantillas exactas de SAP Migration Cockpit.
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-purple-300 flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
            <span>-80% Tiempos de Ciclo</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3: Autonomous GUI/Fiori Agents -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-5 border border-cyan-500/40 hover:border-cyan-400 transition-all duration-300 relative group space-y-3 shadow-neon-cyan/20">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-cyan-950 text-cyan-300 font-mono font-black flex items-center justify-center text-sm border border-cyan-500/50">
              03
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-cyan-300 uppercase font-bold">Agentes Autónomos</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-display group-hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">
            Agentes Autónomos ERP
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300/90 leading-relaxed">
            Bots inteligentes que operan SAP GUI y Fiori de forma autónoma: ejecutan transacciones, simulan cargas, capturan evidencias y generan actas.
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-300 flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
            <span>Operación Desatendida</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4: S/4HANA Clean Core -->
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-5 border border-amber-500/40 hover:border-amber-400 transition-all duration-300 relative group space-y-3 shadow-neon-gold/20">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-amber-950 text-amber-300 font-mono font-black flex items-center justify-center text-sm border border-amber-500/50">
              04
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-amber-300 uppercase font-bold">Clean Core</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-display group-hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors">
            SAP S/4HANA Go-Live
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300/90 leading-relaxed">
            Carga limpia vía Migration Cockpit, cuadre balanceado origen-destino, mínima tasa de rechazo (&lt;0.3%) y total estabilidad funcional Clean Core.
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-amber-300 flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            <span>Cero Deuda Técnica</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Bottom Interactive Quote / Technical Insight -->
      <div class="mt-8 p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-deep-obsidian/80 border border-white/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-2xl">💡</span>
          <p class="text-slate-300 font-normal">
            <strong class="text-white font-semibold">Principio Clean Core:</strong> Mantener el estándar limpio en el ERP mientras la IA y la automatización se orquestan en capas desacopladas (Python, BTP, SAP Joule).
          </p>
        </div>
        <a
          href="#experience"
          class="shrink-0 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300 hover:bg-cyan-500/20 transition-all text-xs font-bold"
        >
          Ver Casos de Clientes →
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
